# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DRAIS — direct database mode (TEMPLATE)
#
# Copy this to `drais.env` in the project root and fill in the real values:
#
#     cp drais.env.example drais.env
#
# The mere PRESENCE of `drais.env` switches the app to direct mode: it talks
# to TiDB Cloud in-process, with no DRAIS server and no connect screen — the
# same way the LongTerm desktop build works.
#
# Delete `drais.env` and the app returns to server mode on the next launch and
# asks which DRAIS server to use. Nothing else needs changing.
#
# `drais.env` is gitignored and must stay that way. Anyone holding a filled-in
# copy has full read/write access to every school's data. Ask whoever
# administers DRAIS for the values; do not paste them into a chat or an issue.
#
# See docs/DEPLOYMENT_MODES.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# TiDB Cloud gateway for your region.
TIDB_HOST=gateway01.eu-central-1.prod.aws.tidbcloud.com

# 4000, not MySQL's 3306.
TIDB_PORT=4000

# Of the form `<cluster-prefix>.root`.
TIDB_USER=

TIDB_PASSWORD=

TIDB_DB=drais
